the server. You work directly with our design and development team.\",\"price\":\"Next step\",\"duration\":\"Duration\",\"ask\":\"Enquire\",\"get\":\"What you get\",\"how\":\"How it works\",\"packagesTitle\":\"A starting point. Shaped around you.\",\"packagesLead\":\"Start with the right foundations. We shape the scope around your goals, requirements and priorities.\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Not sure what you need?\",\"ctaText\":\"A first conversation to understand your requirements. Then we discuss the scope, timeline and a tailored quote.\",\"more\":\"Take a closer look\",\"vat\":\"We talk first. Your requirements shape the scope, suggested timeline and proposal \\u2014 no one-size-fits-all pricing.\",\"soon\":\"Practical AI\",\"soonShort\":\"Planning\",\"soonAsk\":\"Enquire now\",\"status\":\"Status\",\"soonSheet\":{\"label\":\"Status\",\"scale\":\"Planning\",\"steps\":[\"Discovery\",\"Test together\",\"Roll out\"],\"title\":\"Built around your business.\",\"text\":\"We define a useful first use case, test it with your team and agree the safeguards before a controlled rollout. The scope and timeline depend on your requirements.\"},\"modules\":{\"label\":\"Building blocks\",\"title\":\"Modules.\",\"lead\":\"Building blocks that let your website do more than look good. Pick the modules you need, now or later. We discuss the requirements before including them in your proposal.\",\"add\":\"Add\",\"added\":\"Added\",\"count\":e=>1===e?\"module added\":\"modules added\",\"empty\":\"Tap \\u201cAdd\\u201d to take modules with you.\",\"cta\":\"Enquire with this selection\",\"plain\":\"Enquire about a website\",\"reset\":\"Clear\",\"message\":e=>`I am interested in a website with these modules: ${e}.`,\"items\":[{\"id\":\"booking\",\"title\":\"Online booking\",\"text\":\"Customers book themselves, around the clock, straight into your calendar. Confirmation and reminder go out on their own.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Tue 2:30 pm\"}},{\"id\":\"cms\",\"title\":\"Content management\",\"text\":\"Update text, images, product information and opening hours in your browser. We set up the agreed fields and show your team how to manage them.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Mon\\u2013Fri 8\\u20135\",\"b\":\"Save\"}},{\"id\":\"automation\",\"title\":\"Automations\",\"text\":\"An enquiry comes in, the rest runs by itself: a reply to the customer, an entry in the calendar, a quote as a PDF, a note to you.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"PDF\"}},{\"id\":\"payment\",\"title\":\"Online payment\",\"text\":\"Deposits, gift vouchers, course fees: paid by card, Apple Pay or Google Pay, straight into your account.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Paid\"}},{\"id\":\"languages\",\"title\":\"Multilingual\",\"text\":\"German, English, every language your customers speak. With its own address per language, so Google finds all of them.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Willkommen\",\"b\":\"Welcome\",\"c\":\"Benvenuti\"}},{\"id\":\"reviews\",\"title\":\"Google reviews\",\"text\":\"Your real reviews on your own site, always up to date. Trust before anyone picks up the phone.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"4.9\"}},{\"id\":\"newsletter\",\"title\":\"Newsletter\",\"text\":\"Collect addresses, send news. With a confirmation email, as the law requires.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"name@business.com\"}},{\"id\":\"analytics\",\"title\":\"Cookie-free analytics\",\"text\":\"See what gets read and where visitors come from. No cookie banner, no data sent to Google.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"0 cookies\"}},{\"id\":\"chat\",\"title\":\"AI chat\",\"text\":\"Answers questions about prices, opening hours and offers, even at eleven at night. Knows only what is on your site.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Open Saturday?\",\"b\":\"Yes, 9 to 12.\"},\"soon\":true}]},\"assistants\":{\"label\":\"Three assistants\",\"title\":\"Phone, inbox, chat.\",\"lead\":\"On their own or together, set up for your business and with your rules.\",\"items\":[{\"id\":\"phone\",\"title\":\"On the phone\",\"text\":\"Takes calls while you are with a customer, answers simple questions, books appointments and notes call-backs.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Call back 4 pm\"}},{\"id\":\"mail\",\"title\":\"In the inbox\",\"text\":\"Sorts what comes in and prepares replies. You read them over and press send.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Draft\"}},{\"id\":\"chat\",\"title\":\"On the website\",\"text\":\"A chat that knows your prices, hours and offers, and hands over as soon as it gets tricky.\",\"scene\":{\"a\":\"Open Saturday?\",\"b\":\"Yes, 9 to 12.\"}}]},\"detail\":{\"back\":\"All services\",\"fixed\":\"Proposal\",\"fixedValue\":\"After discovery\",\"where\":\"Collaboration\",\"whereValue\":\"Karnal & online\",\"about\":\"What it is about.\",\"faqTitle\":\"Frequent questions.\",\"faqLead\":\"What people often ask before the first meeting. Anything else, ask our team directly.\",\"workTitle\":\"Related work.\",\"next\":\"Next service\",\"localTitle\":\"Based in Karnal. Working together.\",\"localText\":\"getvout is a team based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We work closely with you through discovery, design, development and launch. Meetings and collaboration are planned around your location and requirements.\",\"localLink\":\"Talk to our team\",\"ask\":\"Enquire about this\"}},\"region\":{\"title\":\"Digital agency in the Haryana.\",\"lead\":\"Based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We collaborate with businesses remotely.\",\"mapTitle\":\"Just around the corner.\",\"mapLead\":\"Six neighbouring municipalities, two federal states, one studio in the middle. If your business is here, you do not have far to go to me, and I do not have far to go to you.\",\"mapX\":\"Map\",\"coords\":\"48.360\\u00b0 N \\u00b7 14.897\\u00b0 E\",\"stateOO\":\"Haryana, India\",\"stateNO\":\"Based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We collaborate with businesses remotely.\",\"neighbour\":\"Neighbour\",\"mapNote\":\"As the crow flies from Karnal, town centres from OpenStreetMap.\",\"whyTitle\":\"What being neighbours means.\",\"why\":[{\"title\":\"At the same table.\",\"text\":\"We have the first meeting at your business, free of charge. Photos are taken on site, not picked from a stock library.\"},{\"title\":\"One team, a direct line.\",\"text\":\"You talk to the person who designs and builds. No hotline, no forwarding, no ticket.\"},{\"title\":\"From here, for here.\",\"text\":\"Based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We collaborate with businesses remotely.\"}],\"workTitle\":\"From the neighbourhood.\",\"workLead\":\"Projects for businesses and clubs from the region, as they are online today.\",\"servicesTitle\":\"What I do here.\",\"faqTitle\":\"Asked and answered.\",\"faq\":[{\"q\":\"Do you only work for businesses in the Haryana?\",\"a\":\"Based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We collaborate with businesses remotely.\"},{\"q\":\"Do you come to our business?\",\"a\":\"Based in Karnal, Haryana, India. We collaborate with businesses remotely.\"},{\"q\":\"How much does a website cost at a local digital agency?\",\"a\":\"At getvout.: {prices}. After the first meeting you get a fixed price in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Web agency, digital agency or web designer?\",\"a\":\"For you it is the same thing: getvout. designs and builds your website or online shop, creates logo and photos and looks after hosting. Whether you are looking for a web agency in Karnal, a digital agency in the Haryana or someone to build your website: you end up with the same person.\"},{\"q\":\"Why an agency nearby?\",\"a\":\"Short distances, a face you know and someone who understands the region and its customers. And when something comes up, your contact is not in another country.\"}],\"ctaTitle\":\"Over a coffee?\",\"ctaText\":\"Tell me about your project, at your business or online. The first meeting costs nothing.\"},\"home\":{\"servicesTitle\":\"Everything your business needs online. From one team.\",\"worksTitle\":\"Selected work.\",\"journalTitle\":\"From the journal.\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Tell us about your project.\",\"allWorks\":\"All work\",\"caseStudy\":\"Visit project\",\"allPosts\":\"All articles\"},\"works\":{\"title\":\"Work.\",\"lead\":\"Websites, products and digital experiences by our team. Real projects, shaped around different ambitions.\",\"open\":\"Visit project\",\"empty\":\"The first projects are being added right now.\",\"ctaTitle\":\"Your project could be the next one here.\",\"ctaText\":\"One conversation, a clear scope and an honest assessment. Then you decide.\",\"client\":\"Client\",\"year\":\"Year\",\"kind\":\"Type\",\"services\":\"Services\",\"tech\":\"Technology\",\"live\":\"Visit the site\",\"next\":\"Next project\"},\"video\":{\"untitled\":\"Video\",\"play\":e=>`Play video: ${e}`,\"frame\":e=>`YouTube video: ${e}`,\"notice\":\"This silent project preview is served locally and loads when you press play. It is not a narrated tutorial or a client-results claim.\",\"privacy\":\"More in the privacy policy\",\"watch\":\"Visit the live project\"},\"journal\":{\"title\":\"Journal.\",\"lead\":\"Practical notes on useful websites: interfaces, performance, accessibility and search. Clear explanations, live examples and linked sources.\",\"newest\":\"New in the journal\",\"read\":\"Read on\",\"empty\":\"The first articles are in the works.\",\"minutes\":e=>`${e} min read`,\"next\":\"Next article\",\"back\":\"Back to the journal\"},\"studio\":{\"headline\":\"The getvout team.\",\"lead\":\"A design and development team based in Karnal, India. Different roles, working closely on one connected experience.\",\"portraitAlt\":\"A detail from the getvout project collection.\",\"stories\":\"Stories\",\"values\":\"What we work by\",\"tools\":\"Tools\",\"path\":\"From conversation to launch.\",\"services\":\"What we do\",\"types\":{\"milestone\":\"Next step\",\"work\":\"Work\",\"education\":\"Preparation\"},\"ctaTitle\":\"Let\\u2019s talk about your project.\",\"ctaText\":\"Tell us what you need. We\\u2019ll discuss the scope, suggested timeline and next steps together.\",\"scene\":{\"label\":\"The studio\",\"title\":\"Different roles. One rhythm.\",\"bar\":\"Bar\",\"steps\":[{\"title\":\"A shared space.\",\"text\":\"A project starts with a shared understanding: who it is for, what it needs to do and why it matters.\"},{\"title\":\"A working surface.\",\"text\":\"Goals, content and priorities give the work its structure. The scene is a sketch of that shared workspace.\"},{\"title\":\"Two tracks.\",\"text\":\"Design and development move together. Like two tracks in a mix, each needs to make room for the other.\"},{\"title\":\"A feedback loop.\",\"text\":\"Clear reviews keep the visual experience and its implementation aligned. Listening is part of the work.\"},{\"title\":\"The right rhythm.\",\"text\":\"Timing helps an interface feel calm and responsive. Motion should explain a change, not get in the way.\"},{\"title\":\"A connected experience.\",\"text\":\"The separate parts become one usable system: content, interface, interactions and the code behind them.\"},{\"title\":\"A website.\",\"text\":\"We test, refine and prepare the agreed experience for the people who will use it.\"}],\"words\":{\"vp\":\"Vanishing point\",\"wall\":\"Back wall \\u00b7 5.40 \\u00d7 3.20 m\",\"window\":\"Window \\u00b7 north light\",\"shelf\":\"Records \\u00b7 212\",\"lamp\":\"Light \\u00b7 2700 K\",\"desk\":\"Desk \\u00b7 180 cm\",\"deckA\":\"Deck A \\u00b7 33\\u2153\",\"deckB\":\"Deck B \\u00b7 45\",\"mixer\":\"Mixer\",\"sub\":\"Bass \\u00b7 12\\u2033\",\"bpm\":\"124 BPM\",\"big\":\"Studio\",\"timing\":\"Timing.\"},\"site\":{\"headline\":\"In time.\",\"cta\":\"Let\\u2019s talk\",\"url\":\"getvout.com\",\"cards\":[\"Design\",\"Code\"]},\"ctaHref\":\"/contact\"},\"stack\":{\"title\":\"How the work fits together.\",\"lead\":\"From the experience people see to the systems behind it: four connected layers, one team.\",\"layer\":\"Layer\",\"total\":n => `${n} layers · one team`},\"road\":{\"now\":\"Next\",\"next\":\"Next up: your project.\"},\"sketches\":{\"beat\":\"200 ms\",\"pixel\":\"2 px\",\"night\":\"Review\",\"speed\":\"Fast\",\"access\":\"Tab\",\"done\":\"Ready\",\"rally\":\"Feedback\"},\"awards\":{\"title\":\"The details we care about.\",\"lead\":\"Six things we pay attention to as a team. Explore the sheets to see the thinking behind the work \\u2014 studio principles, not awards or certifications.\",\"certificates\":\"Capability sheets\",\"certificateAlt\":(a,b) => `getvout studio principle: ${b}`,\"badge\":\"Focus\",\"jury\":e=>`Jury \\xb7 ${e} out of 10`,\"public\":\"Public vote\",\"honorable\":\"Jury and community\",\"editorial\":\"Editors' pick\",\"scores\":(e,t,i)=>`Six judges: UI ${e}, UX ${t}, innovation ${i}.`,\"honorableText\":\"We review responsive layouts and connected systems as part of the agreed build.\",\"muzliText\":\"Practical editing and a useful handover help your team keep moving after launch.\",\"link\":e=>`See it on ${e}`,\"open\":\"Open detail\",\"close\":\"Close detail\",\"prev\":\"Previous detail\",\"next\":\"Next detail\"},\"instagram\":{\"label\":\"Project previews\",\"title\":\"A closer look at the work.\",\"lead\":\"A closer look at two projects from our work. Explore the previews, then visit the live experiences. More than twenty projects, seven services, one team.\",\"last30\":\"projects across our work\",\"total\":\"services to build around your needs\",\"gained\":\"team, working together\",\"reels\":\"Previews\",\"follow\":\"Follow on Instagram\",\"watch\":\"Visit project\",\"play\":title => `Play project preview: ${title}`,\"sound\":\"Sound on\",\"mute\":\"Sound off\",\"asOf\":\"20+ projects overall. 8 selected projects are featured on this website. These are not social-reach statistics.\",\"posts\":\"projects\",\"followers\":\"services\",\"following\":\"team\",\"views\":\"featured project\",\"likes\":\"project preview\"}},\"contact\":{\"title\":\"Say hello.\",\"lead\":\"A question, an idea or a project to explore. Tell our team what you have in mind, or get in touch directly.\",\"imageAlt\":\"A magnifier on paper enlarges a small red dot.\",\"brief\":{\"label\":\"A project in mind?\",\"text\":\"Share a few details about your goals. The draft takes shape as you type, and we can discuss the right scope together.\",\"cta\":\"Start a project\"},\"email\":\"Email\",\"phone\":\"WhatsApp\",\"studio\":\"Studio\",\"availability\":\"Availability\",\"profiles\":\"Profiles\",\"country\":\"India\"},\"start\":{\"title\":\"Tell us about your project.\",\"lead\":\"Tell us about your goals, requirements and suggested timing. We\\u2019ll discuss the scope with you before preparing a tailored proposal.\"},\"forms\":{\"name\":\"Name\",\"email\":\"Email\",\"phone\":\"WhatsApp\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"message\":\"Message\",\"phoneHint\":\"Optional WhatsApp number, if you prefer to message.\",\"send\":\"Send message\",\"sending\":\"Sending\",\"arrived\":\"Ready.\",\"thanks\":\"Thank you.\",\"draft\":{\"label\":\"The draft\",\"caption\":\"Draws along while you write.\",\"progress\":\"Draft\",\"placeholder\":\"Your presence\",\"domain\":\"your-company.com\",\"words\":\"Your words\"},\"about\":\"About you\",\"project\":\"The project\",\"frame\":\"Scope & timing\",\"type\":\"What is it about?\",\"existing\":\"Existing website\",\"existingPlaceholder\":\"www.example.com\",\"existingHint\":\"Share your current website or a link that gives us useful context.\",\"tell\":\"Tell us about it\",\"tellHint\":\"What should we build, who is it for and what should it achieve? Tell us about the problem, priorities and any tools it needs to connect to.\",\"budget\":\"Project scope\",\"time\":\"Timing\",\"submit\":\"Send the brief\",\"reply\":\"Requirements first. A proposal after we talk.\",\"privacy\":{\"before\":\"We use these details only to reply to your enquiry. Read our \",\"link\":\"privacy policy\",\"after\":\".\"},\"types\":[{\"value\":\"website\",\"label\":\"Website\"},{\"value\":\"shop\",\"label\":\"Online shop\"},{\"value\":\"software\",\"label\":\"Custom software / app\"},{\"value\":\"branding\",\"label\":\"Brand & logo\"},{\"value\":\"automation\",\"label\":\"Workflow automation\"},{\"value\":\"ai\",\"label\":\"AI assistant\"},{\"value\":\"unsure\",\"label\":\"Not sure yet\"}],\"budgets\":[{\"value\":\"b1\",\"label\":\"A focused project\"},{\"value\":\"b2\",\"label\":\"A complete build\"},{\"value\":\"b3\",\"label\":\"A larger initiative\"},{\"value\":\"b4\",\"label\":\"An ongoing partnership\"},{\"value\":\"open\",\"label\":\"Let\\u2019s discuss\"}],\"timelines\":[{\"value\":\"asap\",\"label\":\"As soon as possible\"},{\"value\":\"quarter\",\"label\":\"In the next three months\"},{\"value\":\"year\",\"label\":\"This year\"},{\"value\":\"flex\",\"label\":\"Flexible\"}],\"errors\":{\"name\":\"Please enter your name.\",\"email\":\"Please enter a valid email address.\",\"message\":\"Please tell us a little more about your enquiry.\",\"type\":\"Please choose at least one type.\",\"budget\":\"Please choose a project scope, or select Let\\u2019s discuss.\",\"timeline\":\"Please choose a time frame.\",\"brief\":\"Tell us a little more so our team can understand what you need.\",\"failed\":\"Please email hello@getvout.com to reach our team directly.\"},\"sentContact\":\"Local preview only \\u2014 your message was not sent or stored. Please email hello@getvout.com.\",\"sentBrief\":\"Local preview only \\u2014 your brief was not sent or stored. Please email hello@getvout.com.\"},\"legal\":{\"imprint\":\"Imprint.\",\"privacy\":\"Privacy.\",\"imprintMissing\":\"The imprint is being added right now.\",\"privacyMissing\":\"The privacy policy is being added right now.\"},\"notFound\":{\"title\":\"Nothing here. Looked closely.\",\"lead\":\"This address does not exist, or no longer does. The way back is short.\",\"home\":\"Back to home\",\"works\":\"See the work\"},\"testimonials\":{\"aria\":\"Client voices\"},\"categories\":{\"website\":\"Website\",\"webapp\":\"Web app\",\"branding\":\"Brand & logo\",\"ecommerce\":\"Online shop\",\"photo\":\"Workflow automation\",\"experiment\":\"Experiment\",\"insight\":\"Insight\",\"process\":\"Craft\",\"news\":\"News\"},\"x\":{\"headline\":\"Heading\",\"intro\":\"Intro\",\"post\":\"Article\",\"quote\":\"Quote\",\"wordmark\":\"Wordmark\",\"value\":\"Value\",\"station\":\"Station\",\"sketch\":\"Sketch\",\"project\":\"Project\",\"package\":\"Package\",\"figure\":\"Figure\",\"origin\":\"Origin\",\"principle\":\"Principle\",\"story\":\"Story\",\"button\":\"Button\",\"call\":\"Call to action\",\"image\":\"Image\",\"cover\":\"Cover\",\"portrait\":\"Work detail\",\"detail\":\"Detail\",\"layer\":\"Layer\",\"map\":\"Map\",\"faq\":\"Question\",\"steps\":\"Process\",\"video\":\"Video\"},\"notes\":{\"optical\":\"Optical size and width of the type follow the line. Nothing is scaled.\",\"corners\":\"12 pixel corners, 1 pixel border. The same across the whole site.\",\"width18\":\"18 characters wide, so the line breaks where it should.\",\"wordmark\":\"getvout. Thoughtful work, made real. The dot becomes the ring at the pointer.\",\"grid12\":\"Twelve columns, like everywhere on the site.\",\"sketch\":\"Drawn as you scroll: first the guides, then the object, then the result.\",\"chapter\":\"Every chapter starts with the same line: same typeface, same size.\",\"anchor\":\"Every service has its own address. The anchor leads exactly here.\",\"width62\":\"At most 62 rem wide. An image does not need the whole screen.\",\"story\":\"First the line, then 24 pixels of air, then the story.\",\"quote\":\"First the line, then 24 pixels of air, then the quote.\",\"row\":\"One line per article. The image only appears when you ask for it.\",\"principle\":\"A line, 20 pixels of air, then the text. The grid holds.\",\"call\":\"One sentence, one button. An ending needs nothing more.\",\"oneImage\":\"One image, one form. Anything more only distracts.\",\"counter\":\"The number counts up as soon as it is in view.\",\"selfBuild\":\"The website builds itself here: real type, real measurements.\",\"column48\":\"The number sits in its own column, 48 pixels wide.\",\"stack\":\"The cards stack as you scroll, each 20 pixels lower than the last.\",\"fan\":\"The card under the pointer gets the room: 3.4 to 1.\",\"program\":\"Every detail is considered by our team.\",\"detail\":\"The second image is smaller and shifted right: it complements, it does not compete.\",\"dark\":\"The recommended package is dark, all others light. One difference is enough.\",\"cover\":\"The cover is the real project, as it is online today.\",\"portrait\":\"A real project detail in the original parallax image frame.\",\"lost\":\"Same typeface, same size here too. Lost, but not gone.\",\"width32\":\"32 characters per line: the limit where the eye starts to jump.\",\"width30\":\"30 characters per line. Any more reads worse.\",\"width16\":\"16 characters wide. The break is set, not accidental.\",\"width14\":\"14 characters wide, so the title sits on two or three lines.\",\"button\":\"At least 44 pixels tall. Anything less, no thumb will hit.\",\"layer\":\"Every layer is a real element, not a picture of one.\",\"map\":\"Real positions, calculated distances. 24 pixels make a kilometre.\",\"faq\":\"One click opens it. The answer is already in the HTML, for search engines too.\",\"steps\":\"One line, one dot per step. A process needs nothing more.\",\"service\":\"Every service has its own page: its own address, title and questions.\",\"video\":\"Until you click: a still from this server. YouTube only loads when you ask for it.\",\"award\":\"Six studio principles, not awards or certifications. Hover to fan the stack; click to explore a detail.\",\"badges\":\"Grey until you take a closer look.\"},\"brandWord\":\"getvout\"};\nglobalThis.__getvoutHome={\n  menu(original) {return original;},\n  translations(original,pathname) {\n    if(pathname===\"/en/studio\") return studio;\n    if(pathname===\"/en/journal/website-walkthrough-video\") return walkthrough;\n    if(pathname.startsWith(\"/en/journal\")) return journal;\n    return original;\n  }\n};\n})();\n(function(){var d=document.documentElement;d.classList.add('js');try{var b=/bot|crawl|spider|slurp|google|bing|duckduck|lighthouse|headless/i.test(navigator.userAgent)||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce), (min-height: 3000px)').matches;if(b){d.classList.add('still')}var t=localStorage.getItem('getvout-theme');if(t==='dark'){d.setAttribute('data-theme',t)}if(!b&&sessionStorage.getItem('getvout-intro')!=='1'&&location.search.indexOf('utm_source=instagram')<0){d.classList.add('intro')}}catch(e){}})();"}}],["$","script",null,{"defer":true,"src":"/lens/script.js","data-do-not-track":"true"}],["$","noscript",null,{"children":"$14"}]]}],["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"#inhalt","className":"skip-link","children":"Skip to content"}],["$","$Lfffd",null,{}],"$L16"]}]]}]
9:[["$","$L1e",null,{"headline":"Take a closer look.","lead":"Design and software studio from Karnal, India. One team, both sides: design and code.","primary":{"label":"Start a project","href":"/start-project"},"secondary":{"label":"See the work","href":"/work"}}],["$","$L1f",null,{"title":"From a line to a button.","steps":[{"title":"A line.","text":"Every project starts with guides. Where things belong is measured, not guessed."},{"title":"A grid.","text":"Columns, gaps, a surface. The scaffolding everything lines up with later."},{"title":"A layout.","text":"Lines become surfaces: navigation, headline, image, button. Order first, ornament later."},{"title":"A typeface.","text":"Type is attitude. Size, width and line breaks are tuned to every single line."},{"title":"A colour.","text":"Paper, ink, one red. A brand needs no more when it fits."},{"title":"A line of code.","text":"What we design, we also build. By hand, readable, no page builder."},{"title":"Online.","text":"Quick to load, sharp on every screen, found by search engines."},{"title":"Your turn.","text":"Everything you have just seen is in this one button. Press it, and we’ll build yours."}],"cta":"$9:0:props:primary","headline":"Take a closer look.","lead":"Design and software studio from Karnal, India. One team, both sides: design and code.","image":{"id":14,"alt":"A magnifier on paper enlarges a small red dot.","caption":null,"credit":null,"updatedAt":"2026-11-24T00:00:00+05:30","createdAt":"2026-11-24T00:00:00+05:30","url":"/api/media/file/kontakt-lupe.jpeg","thumbnailURL":null,"filename":"kontakt-lupe.jpeg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":286397,"width":2848,"height":1600,"focalX":50,"focalY":50,"sizes":{"thumb":{"url":"/api/media/file/kontakt-lupe-480x270.jpg","width":480,"height":270,"mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":10189,"filename":"kontakt-lupe-480x270.jpg"},"card":{"url":"/api/media/file/kontakt-lupe-1024x575.jpg","width":1024,"height":575,"mimeType":"image/jpeg","filesize":38070,"filenam